IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pgmg-status-and-benefits`

-- Pioneer Generation and Merdeka Generation Funds Act 2014, ss 12-14A, 16, 17, 18, 21, 22, 23, 25 and 27(4) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pioneer-generation-and-merdeka-generation-funds-act-2014.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

