§ `ss 12 and 18(1)`

#ASSERT `the person is a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1940, a citizen since before 1986`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1945, naturalised in 1990`
#ASSERT `the person is a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1945, naturalised in 2000, verified as a Pioneer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1955, naturalised in 2005`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a Pioneer who held another citizenship in 2017 and gave it up in 2018`
#ASSERT `the person is a Pioneer` `a Pioneer whose other citizenship arises only from Article 139`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a Merdeka Generation Senior whose other citizenship arises only from Article 139`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a Pioneer declared to have ceased after a conviction`
#ASSERT `the person is a Pioneer` `a Merdeka Generation Senior later verified as a Pioneer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Pioneer` `a former citizen born 1940`

#ASSERT `the person may be determined a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1945, naturalised in 2000, verified as a Pioneer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may be determined a Pioneer` `a citizen born 1955, naturalised in 2005`

§ `ss 12A, 12B and 18(2)`

#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1940, a citizen since before 1986`
#ASSERT `the person is a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1955, a citizen since before 1996`
#ASSERT `the person is a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1945, naturalised in 1990`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1955, naturalised in 2005`
