#ASSERT `the person may be determined a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1955, naturalised in 2005`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may be determined a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1955, a citizen since before 1996`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may be determined a Merdeka Generation Senior` `a citizen born 1940, a citizen since before 1986`

#ASSERT NOT `the person is both` `a Merdeka Generation Senior later verified as a Pioneer`

